# HR Attrition Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analyzes employee attrition using HR Analytics data.

## Tools Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Power BI

## Objectives

- Calculate attrition rate
- Identify attrition drivers
- Analyze employee behavior
- Provide retention recommendations

## Dashboard

(Add screenshots here)

## Key Findings

- Overtime impacts attrition
- Job satisfaction affects retention
- Salary influences turnover

## Recommendations

- Reduce overtime
- Improve employee engagement
- Review compensation policies
